171	1703	1798	now we're talking!	/naʊ wɪr ˈtɔkɪŋ/	idiom / exclamation (informal)	An enthusiastic response meaning that a new suggestion, improvement, amount, or development is much more appealing or satisfactory.	that's more like it, now that's better, yes!	'How about pizza and beer?' 'Now we're talking!' / A 30% discount? Now we're talking.	Not merely agreement; often signals a noticeable improvement over what was previously proposed.		
