192	1916	2021	Slim Jim	/ˈslɪm ˌdʒɪm/	brand / product name	A U.S. brand of packaged meat snacks, especially thin meat sticks.	meat stick, meat snack	He grabbed a Slim Jim at the gas station.	CORRECTION: brand styling is 'Slim Jim' (two words), not 'slimjim'. Trademark/product-reference card; avoid calling all similar snacks Slim Jims generically.		
