255	2545	2685	convo / convos	/ˈkɑnvoʊz/	noun (informal shortening)	Informal shortening of 'conversation'; plural 'convos'. Common in casual speech, texting, and social media.	conversation, chat, talk	We had a long convo about the ending. / Our late-night convos get weird.	Normalize singular/plural. Casual, not generally used in formal prose.		
