356	3559	3806	irl	N/A	abbreviation, internet slang	Short for 'in real life'; referring to events or situations in the physical world rather than online.	offline, in person	We finally met irl after months of chatting online.	Used in online communication to contrast with virtual interactions. 日本語では「現実世界で」。		
