362	3616	4307	FOH	/ˌef.oʊˈeɪtʃ/	slang abbreviation	A blunt abbreviation of 'fuck outta here,' used to dismiss something, express disbelief, or reject a claim; tone can range from joking to hostile.	get outta here, no way, bullshit	FOH—you really expect me to believe that?	Very informal and vulgar. In other contexts FOH can mean front of house; this card targets the slang search.		voca_0099–0109 | unmatched | folders: voca_0103 | searches: foh meanig
