504	5034	4409	haltingly	/ˈhɔːl.tɪŋ.li/	adverb	In a hesitant, stop-and-start, or uncertain manner.	hesitantly, falteringly	He answered haltingly, searching for the right words.	Often describes speech, reading, movement, or progress.		voca_0099–0109 | unmatched | folders: voca_0100 | searches: haltingly
